		"description": "Complete API collection for Voucher & Promotion Management Service\n\n**Production URL:** https://voucher-promotion-assignment.onrender.com\n**Local URL:** http://localhost:5000\n\n**Authentication:**\n1. First, login via `/api/v1/auth/login` to get JWT token\n2. Copy the token from response\n3. Use it in Authorization header for all other requests: `Bearer <token>`",
